{"id":"msg_m_ex_mint_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_mint","label":"Mint · Nikke"},"label":"1. Kitten! ( ΦωΦ )","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_mint_02","speakers":{"mint_i":"Mint"},"icons":{"mint_i":"si_c600_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_1","text":"Kitten! ( ΦωΦ )","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_2","text":"This is my personal number.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_3","text":"Make sure you save it, okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_4","text":"Your personal number?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_5","text":"Yep, hehe! Comes with being a pop star, I guess.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_6","text":"I actually use two numbers.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_7","text":"One's strictly for work, and this one's my personal number.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_8","text":"Not many people have this one, actually.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_9","text":"Maybe Anis, Prika, and Avistar?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_10","text":"The president has it too, of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_11","text":"Mrs. Miss as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_12","text":"And I guess a few important producers and writers have it too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_13","text":"Come to think of it, more people have it than I realized, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_14","text":"Looks like it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_15","text":"Still, you're the first person","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_16","text":"outside the industry to get it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_17","text":"So you should be proud of yourself!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_18","text":"Hehe, yeah, I kinda am.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_19","text":"By the way,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_20","text":"what do people usually talk about","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_21","text":"when they text like this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_22","text":"Just regular stuff, y'know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_23","text":"Normal stuff?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_24","text":"Like \"Do I look pretty today? ♡\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_25","text":"\"Let me share some makeup tips with you!\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_26","text":"Stuff like that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_27","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_28","text":"I wouldn't call that normal.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_29","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_30","text":"I actually use a separate app","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_31","text":"to message my fans pretty often,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_32","text":"but aside from that, I don't really text much.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_33","text":"What about Prika and Avistar?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_34","text":"With Avistar, we mostly talk about schedules.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_35","text":"As for Prika...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_36","text":"She mostly just nags me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_37","text":"and I kind of ignore her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_38","text":"That's usually how it goes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_39","text":"Just think of it as casually reaching out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_40","text":"Like, \"Hey, what're you up to?\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_41","text":"Oh, that sounds fun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_42","text":"Then I'll message you like that every now and then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_43","text":"And of course,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_44","text":"you can text me anytime too, Kitten. Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_45","text":"Yeah, got it. Let's keep in touch.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mint_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mint_01_46","text":"For sure! <(*ΦωΦ*)/","jump":null}],"chat":true}